{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55659","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十七 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一生占断白云乡，适意孤高志自强。\n报晓音声栖鸟语，漏春消息早梅香。\n吟经徐傍芙蕖岸，得偈闲书薜荔墙。\n大道最亲无达者，苦擕瓶锡叩禅堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55659.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55659","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}